From abhsahu@nvidia.com Mon, 15 Sep 2025 17:23:32 +0530
From: Abhishek Sahu <abhsahu@nvidia.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Sep 2025 17:23:32 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] platform/arm64: Fix FFA notification count initialization

Backport of NVIDIA SAUCE 8972b5881db1 from 24.04_linux-nvidia-6.17-next
onto Linux 6.12.94.

Upstream-commit: 8972b5881db1

diff --git a/drivers/platform/arm64/nvidia-ffa-ec.c b/drivers/platform/arm64/nvidia-ffa-ec.c
index 1c9da1bcd..754f5ac53 100644
--- a/drivers/platform/arm64/nvidia-ffa-ec.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/arm64/nvidia-ffa-ec.c
@@ -619,7 +619,7 @@ static int nvidia_ffa_ec_service_probe(struct ffa_device *ffa_dev)
 		return -ENODEV;
 	}
 
-	nvidia_ec_ffa_dev = devm_kmalloc(&ffa_dev->dev,
+	nvidia_ec_ffa_dev = devm_kzalloc(&ffa_dev->dev,
 					 sizeof(*nvidia_ec_ffa_dev),
 					 GFP_KERNEL);
 	if (!nvidia_ec_ffa_dev) {
